            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, justice Souter highlighted a potential anomaly where a recidivism enhancement could result in a ten\u2011year sentence despite a five\u2011year statutory maximum."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
