            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Government, the government asserts that the rule of lenity does not apply because the statute\u2019s text is not susceptible to the respondent\u2019s interpretation."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Government",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "5564e048b47ed164e40c24bf64812da3f87f7fb081171eeed2c5850164d16c12",
